This photo shows a nearly empty tray, so only leftovers remain. There is a sauce smear on the plate with a few bits of onion, residue in the two bowls, and small cups with a little dark liquid (maybe soy sauce or coffee) and some residue.

I estimate roughly 15 g of sauce and bits on the plate, 5 g in the bowls, and 5 g of liquid in the cups, about 25 g in total. At roughly 1.2 kcal/g for sauce, that comes to about 30 kcal.

